# Built into the client bundle by Vite, so the backend env vars (LLM_*, and
# friends) are configured in the Vercel dashboard instead. These Firebase web
# keys are public by design: they ship in the browser bundle and are gated by
# the Firestore/Storage rules and the Auth authorized-domains list.
#
# The API is served from this same origin, so API requests use a relative /api
# path and no backend hostname is baked in. Set VITE_API_BASE_URL only if the
# API moves to a different origin.
